<% if @is_test %>
Channel test ✅

This is a test notification from Wokku — your <%= @notification.channel.capitalize %> channel is configured correctly.

You'll receive notifications for the events you subscribed to.

Manage rules: <%= dashboard_notifications_url %>
<% else %>
<%= @app.name %> — <%= @event.humanize %>
<% if @deploy&.commit_sha.present? %>
Commit: <%= @deploy.commit_sha[0, 7] %>
<% end %>
<% if @deploy&.release&.version %>
Release: v<%= @deploy.release.version %>
<% end %>
Open: <%= dashboard_app_url(@app) %>
<% end %>
